# Engineering Team Instructions for QMS Portal (.cursorrules)

# Primary rules
AGENTS.md is the shared rule file for every AI agent in this repo. Read it first; it wins over this file.
Before changing code under apps/, follow the pre-development gate in the `qms-module-development` skill
(.agents/skills/qms-module-development/SKILL.md) and wait for the user's approval of the plan.

# Stack (current)
- API: Cloudflare Workers + Hono (ESM) + Cloudflare D1 (SQLite) + R2, cron via scheduled() in apps/api/src/index.js.
  Migrations: new numbered file in apps/api/migrations (never edit merged ones). Tests: Vitest on a local D1.
- Web: React 19, Vite, Tailwind CSS v4, Zustand, React Router 7. Tests: Vitest + Playwright.
- JavaScript only (no TypeScript, no type-check step). pnpm only.

# Workflow & roles (.agents/*.md)
1. Orchestrator: analyse the request, scope the blast radius.
2. Architect: schema, state, backward compatibility.
3. Frontend Coder: React 19, Tailwind CSS v4, Zustand, DESIGN.md tokens.
4. Backend Coder: Hono routes, D1 migrations, scheduled() jobs, pdf-lib.
5. QA Tester: `pnpm run lint`, module tests while working, `pnpm run check` before submitting.
6. Security Auditor: RBAC, stamps, watermarks, audit trail.

# Brownfield Rules (.rules/brownfield-rules.md)
1. NEVER refactor or rewrite unrelated existing code.
2. Match existing naming conventions, code style, and file structures.
3. NEVER update or add library dependencies without explicit user permission.
4. ALWAYS inspect existing files, utilities, and services before writing new code.
